<p><span style="font-weight:400">It’s only <span class="aBn" data-term="goog_1481413600" tabindex="0"><span class="aQJ">Thursday</span></span>, and for us at Haptik that means it's time for the </span><strong>Haptik Weekend Sale!!!</strong></p>

<p><span style="font-weight:400">You know how it works: For </span><strong>48 hours only</strong><span style="font-weight:400"> <span class="aBn" data-term="goog_1481413601" tabindex="0"><span class="aQJ">on Saturday</span></span> and <span class="aBn" data-term="goog_1481413602" tabindex="0"><span class="aQJ">Sunday</span></span>, exclusive branded products go on sale on Haptik at </span><strong>LOOT</strong><span style="font-weight:400"> prices. Further to these highly discounted prices, here is a chance to win additional cashback coupons which make the effective price </span><strong>almost 90% off!!</strong></p>

<p><span style="font-weight:400">This weekend, we are featuring </span><strong>power banks by Ambrane</strong><span style="font-weight:400">. Never run out of battery again with these best in class 10000 mAh power banks. &nbsp;To win an additional </span><strong>75% cashback coupon (up to Rs. 1,000) </strong><span style="font-weight:400">for this product, all you need to do is:</span></p>

